# Derived image tiers and catalogue data. Marked binary so git does not try to
# diff or merge them — they are regenerated wholesale, never edited by hand, and
# a textual merge of a WebP is meaningless.
*.webp   binary
*.png    binary

# The catalogue and audit files are generated too. Diffing them is useful (an
# unexpected change to data/supply.json is exactly the thing to notice in
# review), so they stay text — just never hand-edited.
data/*.json text eol=lf

# Keep line endings stable for the contract sources: their compiled hash is
# pinned in lib/contract.ts, and a CRLF checkout would change the address.
*.es     text eol=lf
